<title>USA: Nevada $81 mln GO bonds priced, 5.05 pct top yield.</title>
<headline>Nevada $81 mln GO bonds priced, 5.05 pct top yield.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE OF NEVADA</p>
<p>RE: $81,195,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION (LIMITED TAX) BONDS</p>
<p>REFUNDING SERIES JULY 1, 1997 A&amp;B</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		    S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>	DATED: 07/15/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 11/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 05/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>05/15/1998		  830M    5.00  %	  3.85</p>
<p>05/15/1999		   10M    5.00  %	  4.15</p>
<p>05/15/2000		   10M    5.00  %	  4.25</p>
<p>05/15/2001		   15M    5.00  %	  4.35</p>
<p>05/15/2002		   15M    5.00  %	  4.45</p>
<p>05/15/2003		2,060M    5.00  %	  4.55</p>
<p>05/15/2004		2,165M    5.00  %	  4.60</p>
<p>05/15/2005		1,815M    5.00  %	  4.65</p>
<p>05/15/2006	     12,425M    6.00  %	  4.70</p>
<p>05/15/2007	     13,260M    6.00  %	  4.75</p>
<p>05/15/2009	     15,145M    6.00  %	  4.90</p>
<p>05/15/2010	     16,170M    6.00  %	  5.00</p>
<p>05/15/2011	     17,275M    6.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>		   EXTRAORDINARY OPTIONAL PRIOR REDEMPTION</p>
<p>				THE BONDS, OR PORTIONS THEREOF,</p>
<p>MATURING ON AND AFTER</p>
<p>		   MAY 15, 2008 SHALL BE SUBJECT TO REDEMPTION</p>
<p>PRIOR TO THEIR</p>
<p>		   RESPECTIVE MATURITIES, AT THE OPTION OF THE</p>
<p>STATE, ON AND AFTER</p>
<p>		   MAY 15, 2007 BUT ONLY IN THE EVENT THE BOARD</p>
<p>DETERMINES A CHANGE</p>
<p>		   OF USE HAS OCCURRED AS A RESULT OF WHICH</p>
<p>EXERCISE OF THIS</p>
<p>		   REDEMPTION WILL IN PART SATISFY THE STATE'S</p>
<p>OBLIGATIONS UNDER</p>
<p>		   SECTION 44 HEREOF IN WHOLE OR IN PART AT ANY</p>
<p>TIME FROM ANY</p>
<p>		   MATURITIES SELECTED BY THE STATE AND BY LOT</p>
<p>WITHIN A MATURITY</p>
<p>		   (GIVING PROPORTIONATE WEIGHT TO BONDS IN</p>
<p>DENOMINATIONS LARGER</p>
<p>		   THAN $5000), AT A PRICE EQUAL TO THE ISSUE</p>
<p>PRICE OF EACH BOND, OR</p>
<p>		   PORTION THEREOF, SO REDEEMED, ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>TO THE REDEMPTION</p>
<p>		   DATE, AND A PREMIUM COMPUTED IN ACCORDANCE WITH</p>
<p>THE FOLLOWING</p>
<p>		   SCHEDULE:</p>
<p>					    $105 CALL (WILL NOT DECLINE)</p>
<p>				IN THE CASE OF BONDS OF A DENOMINATION</p>
<p>LARGER THAN</p>
<p>		   $5000, A PORTION OF SUCH BONDS ($5000 OR ANY</p>
<p>INTEGRAL MULTIPLE</p>
<p>		   THEROF) MAY BE REDEEMED, IN WHICH CASE THE</p>
<p>REGISTRAR SHALL,</p>
<p>		   WITHOUT CHARGE TO THE OWNER OF SUCH BOND,</p>
<p>AUTHENTICATE AND ISSUE</p>
<p>		   A REPLACEMENT BOND OR BONDS FOR THE UNREDEEMED</p>
<p>PORTION THEREOF.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, July 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on August 5, 1997.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
